{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 120,
    "dDurationMs": 3289,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Suppose you're ambitious enough to try to\ndescribe everything in the observable universe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3409,
    "dDurationMs": 2101,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in one single mathematical equation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5510,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "DONE."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6510,
    "dDurationMs": 4570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK, so that doesn't include gravity or a few\nother little things… but the point is, this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11080,
    "dDurationMs": 3969,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "equation describes, with incredible precision,\nwhat the earth is made of, what keeps the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15049,
    "dDurationMs": 4971,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sun burning, what allows us to breath, taste,\nmow the lawn, blow things up, and watch internet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20020,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "videos…"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21230,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all in one equation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22700,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's humbly called \"The Standard Model\"\n- because even when they discover the most"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26340,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "accurate scientific theory known to man, physicists\nare modest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29720,
    "dDurationMs": 4959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the universe is a pretty big place (maybe\neven infinitely big), so it's reasonable to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34679,
    "dDurationMs": 3341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "think that you might need a lot more than\njust one equation to describe it all - so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38020,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why is the standard model so simple?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40280,
    "dDurationMs": 4189,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For starters, it's more like a recipe - and\njust as a recipe for cake assumes you already"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44469,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "know how to sift flour, beat egg whites, build\nan oven and grow wheat, this equation assumes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49269,
    "dDurationMs": 4011,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you already know about path integrals, gauge\ntheories and so on - so there's a lot more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53280,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than meets the eye."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54280,
    "dDurationMs": 4289,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As for why an incredibly small set of mathematical\nrules appear to govern the universe?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58569,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, that's a deep and unanswered question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61129,
    "dDurationMs": 4281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the data show that math is the language\nof the cosmos – pick a few elementary particles,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65410,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "set them on a high-energy collision course,\nand BAM!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68440,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When the sparks fly, the standard model will\ndescribe the fireworks – to twelve-decimal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72380,
    "dDurationMs": 1130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "places of precision!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73510,
    "dDurationMs": 4250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyway, in the next few MinutePhysics videos\nwe'll explain all sorts of the cool ingredients"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77760,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that make up the standard model, like quantum\nfields, fundamental forces, quarks, gluons,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82290,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ghost particles, and of course, the higgs\nfield."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85010,
    "dDurationMs": 13170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's an ambitious task, and I hope you're\nready for it!"
    } ]
  } ]
}
